    "Open Sticky Notes.",
    "Create a new note.",
    "Enter `Water (one gallon per person per day for several days, for drinking and sanitation)` in the note.",
    "Add `Food (at least a several-day supply of non-perishable food)` to the note.",
    "Add `Battery-powered or hand crank radio and a NOAA Weather Radio with tone alert` to the note."
